      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. It's definitely professional. \n\nHowever, looking at the pre-submission audit, the score came back a bit low. Since our reviewers are so specialized, we really need to make sure we're signaling the depth of our technical expertise right away. \n\nCan you expand on this? Try to be much more granular/specific with the molecular mechanisms and the bioanalytical techniques. We need that jargon score to be significantly higher to pass the next internal check, but like I said before—keep it scientifically grounded. Don't just add fluff, but really lean into the heavy technical terminology of the process.",
